*sread* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''sread(handle, maxBytes)''

Reads bytes from a socket handle with explicit buffer size limit.

*Parameters:*
- ''handle'': Socket handle
- ''maxBytes'': Maximum bytes to read

*Returns:*
- Bytes
- ''err'' on failure

*Misc:*
- ''maxBytes = 0'' is not allowed because of safety for now.
